<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daehan seeks 22,000T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Daehan seeks 22,000T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd has invited tenders for 22,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Wednesday, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said shipment was set for February 1-28 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
